{"suttaId":"tha-ap185","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[7048,7066],"vripara":"12"},"segments":{"tha-ap185:0.3":"Koṭumbariyattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap185:1.1":"“Kaṇikāraṃva jotantaṃ, nisinnaṃ pabbatantare;","tha-ap185:1.3":"Appameyyaṃva udadhiṃ, vitthataṃ dharaṇiṃ yathā.","tha-ap185:2.1":"“Pūjitaṃ [paretaṃ (sī.)] devasaṅghena, nisabhājāniyaṃ yathā;","tha-ap185:2.3":"Haṭṭho haṭṭhena cittena, upāgacchiṃ naruttamaṃ.","tha-ap185:3.1":"“Sattapupphāni paggayha, koṭumbarasamākulaṃ;","tha-ap185:3.3":"Buddhassa abhiropesiṃ, sikhino lokabandhuno.","tha-ap185:4.1":"“Ekattiṃse ito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhiropayiṃ;","tha-ap185:4.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap185:5.1":"“Ito vīsatikappamhi, mahānelasanāmako;","tha-ap185:5.3":"Eko āsi mahātejo, cakkavattī mahabbalo.","tha-ap185:6.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap185:7.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā koṭumbariyo thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap185:8.1":"Koṭumbariyattherassāpadānaṃ tatiyaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
